{
  "info": {
    "name": "MrElote API",
    "description": "Colección de endpoints del proyecto MrElote.\n\nAuth: cookies HttpOnly (`mre_access`, `mre_refresh`) que el backend setea en `Set-Cookie`. Postman Desktop las almacena automáticamente en el cookie jar y las reenvía en cada request al mismo dominio. **NO** se usa Authorization Bearer.\n\nVariables por ambiente (ver Environments): `baseUrl`, `frontendOrigin`, `adminCorreo`, `adminPassword`, `clienteCorreo`, `clientePassword`.\n\nFlujo recomendado:\n1. Selecciona environment (Local Docker / Local Cloud / Render).\n2. Login admin → cookies almacenadas.\n3. Resto de endpoints usan las cookies automáticamente.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// OriginCheckFilter del backend rechaza POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE sin Origin",
          "// que matchee MRELOTE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS. Inyecta Origin = frontendOrigin si falta.",
          "const method = pm.request.method.toUpperCase();",
          "const mutating = ['POST', 'PUT', 'PATCH', 'DELETE'].includes(method);",
          "if (mutating) {",
          "    const hasOrigin = pm.request.headers.has('Origin');",
          "    const frontendOrigin = pm.environment.get('frontendOrigin');",
          "    if (!hasOrigin && frontendOrigin) {",
          "        pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'Origin', value: frontendOrigin });",
          "    }",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan Pérez\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3001234567\",\n  \"correo\": \"{{clienteCorreo}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{clientePassword}}\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle 10 # 20-30\",\n  \"redirectTo\": \"{{frontendOrigin}}/confirm.html\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "HU-01. Crea cuenta de cliente vía signup público de Supabase. Supabase envía email de confirmación al `correo`. Mientras no confirme, el login fallará con 400 `email_not_confirmed`.\n\nPolítica de password: mínimo 8, una mayúscula, una minúscula, un dígito, un carácter especial.\n\n`redirectTo` debe estar en la whitelist de Supabase → Authentication → URL Configuration."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login cliente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Set-Cookie mre_access', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie') || '').to.include('mre_access'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"{{clienteCorreo}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{clientePassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "HU-02. Autentica con correo+password. Backend valida contra Supabase, recibe tokens, los pone en cookies HttpOnly `mre_access` y `mre_refresh`. El body responde con el perfil del usuario."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Set-Cookie mre_access', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie') || '').to.include('mre_access'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"{{adminCorreo}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Login del admin sembrado por `DataInitializer` (Admin API, `email_confirm: true`). NO requiere confirmación."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve perfil del usuario autenticado. Requiere cookie `mre_access` válida."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refrescar sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Intercambia `mre_refresh` por par nuevo de cookies. 401 si el refresh es inválido (limpia cookies)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revoca el token en Supabase (best-effort) y limpia ambas cookies vía Set-Cookie con Max-Age=0."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Catálogo (público)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar categorías",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories"]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint público."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar productos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "1", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "available", "value": "true", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "HU-04. Filtros opcionales `categoryId`, `available`. Endpoint público."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Estado del negocio",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/business/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["business", "status"]
            },
            "description": "RN-06. Considera horario + cierre manual. Endpoint público."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Carrito",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ver carrito",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["cart"]
            },
            "description": "HU-08. Carrito activo del usuario autenticado."
          },
          "response": []
